# Historical: Hindsight / OmniRoute project memory env

> **Archived (BOD-182).** Canonical durable memory is MemoryPlane
> (`verdict/memory_*`, ADR-004/009/033/034). Hindsight-via-OmniRoute env vars
> are not part of the supported operator surface.
>
> The historical project-memory note was retired with `docs/archive/`.

